# Kaggle research cache. Other people's notebook source is NOT committed --
# redistributing it through your repo is a licensing question you do not want
# to answer by accident. Discussion text, writeups and the manifest are left
# committable so the daily job can surface their changes as a reviewable diff.
research/notebooks/

# Raw r.jina.ai page captures used to build research/rendered/. Regenerable,
# full of page furniture, and large; the cleaned rendition is what gets read.
research/.jina_raw/

# Ops runtime state (machine-local; the templates and scripts stay versioned)
